<title>MEXICO: Jugos del Valle buys Grupo Tropicana.</title>
<headline>Jugos del Valle buys Grupo Tropicana.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican beverage firm Jugos del Valle said it had reached a deal to buy sector counterpart Grupo Tropicana and its subsidiaries, in a report to the Mexican Stock Exchange (BMV) on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Jugos del Valle will physically take over Grupo Tropicana as a going concern on Aug. 10, 1997,&quot; the company report said.</p>
<p>The company did not give the purchase price of Tropicana.</p>
<p>(( --Tomas de la Rosa, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7912))</p>
